  id: tutorial.jump_and_air
  title: Jump and Air Control
  description: The same body controls still matter in the air. They help you stay
    balanced before landing.
  autoAccept: 0
  tutorialQuest: 1
  stages:
  - id: tutorial.jump_and_air.stage1
    title: Stay Deliberate in the Air
    description: Jump first, then keep using body and ski inputs so the landing feels
      controlled instead of lucky.
    objectives:
    - id: tutorial.jump_and_air.jump_adjust
      title: Jump and adjust in the air
      description: Press Space, then use W or S with A or D in the air to steady
        yourself before landing.
